<title>INDIA: India VSNL to offer 18.9 mln shrs in GDRS.</title>
<headline>India VSNL to offer 18.9 mln shrs in GDRS.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian telcommunications firm Videsh Sanchar Nigam Ltd (VSNL) will offer 18.9 million shares, represented by 37.8 million Global Depositary Receipts (GDRs), a company pamphlet said.</p>
<p>The booklet said the GDRs will be listed on the London Stock Exchange, and a road show for the launch of the issue will kick off in Hong Kong on Monday, March 10.</p>
